OL,3,AWoman charged with juror intimidation
OL,4,Ain Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman, who was arrested for taking
OL,7,Fphotos of jury members outside the
OL,8,Fcourthouse in the Lindsay Clancy trial,
OL,9,Fhas been charged with aggravated
OL,10,Fintimidation of a juror.
OL,12,FDawn Light, 56, is accused of sitting
OL,13,Fin a restricted area outside the
OL,14,FPlymouth courthouse and photographing
OL,15,Fjurors as they exited the building on
OL,16,FTuesday. Her lawyer called it a
OL,17,Fmisunderstanding as she pleaded not
OL,18,Fguilty to the charges.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
