OL,3,AWoman charged with juror intimidation
OL,4,Ain Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLindsay Clancy, 36, is charged with the
OL,7,Fmurders of her three children. The
OL,8,Flivestreamed trial has captured
OL,9,Fnational and international media
OL,10,Fattention, and drawn strong, often
OL,11,Fdeeply divided reactions from
OL,12,Faudiences.
OL,14,FThe jury has been deliberating on the
OL,15,Fcase since Thursday.
